It drags us right back to our very first analogy.

51:30.300 --> 51:31.300
The filing system.

51:31.300 --> 51:32.300
Exactly.

51:32.300 --> 51:35.300
Maybe the physical documents and the folders don't even exist.

51:35.300 --> 51:40.300
Maybe the only thing that is actually real are the rules for how we sort the empty space.

51:40.300 --> 51:46.300
It fundamentally challenges you to question the physical nature of the landscape we started this entire conversation on.

51:46.300 --> 51:47.300
It absolutely does.

51:47.300 --> 51:51.300
And on that slightly existential note, we will leave you to ponder it.

51:51.300 --> 52:03.300
We invite you to look around your world today and think about the invisible structures, the deliberate blind spots in your own mental transformations and the intersecting mathematical symmetries that are secretly governing your daily life.

52:03.300 --> 52:07.300
Thanks for joining us on the same dive.

52:08.300 --> 52:12.300
Thank you.

